# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEWSLETTER_FORM_URL
#
# The single configuration value that wires up the newsletter form.
# When set, the sign-up form on the homepage, writing page and at the
# end of every article POSTs an `email` field to this URL (for example
# a Buttondown, ConvertKit or Mailchimp hosted form endpoint).
#
# When unset (or empty) the site instead shows a graceful placeholder
# message: "Daily issues are launching soon. Follow on LinkedIn in the
# meantime." — no broken form, no dead endpoint.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the value before connecting a
# real email provider.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
NEWSLETTER_FORM_URL=
